coreA":0,"scoreB":1,"winner":"Trash n Stache","slotA":"W9","slotB":"W10"}],"bracketSeeded":true,"ticker":["WELCOME TO THE 2020 B.B.G.C. \u2014 The covid year. Four groups, four teams per group. Three from each group advance to the knockout round.","GROUP PLAY \u00b7 RED \u2014 The defending champions arrived and made a statement. Hawkeyes 3-0, 58 points, untouched. The Seekers took second at 2-1, and I Can't Decide slipped in at 1-2 ahead of winless Guns n Rollers. HAWKEYES, THE SEEKERS and I CAN'T DECIDE advance.","GROUP PLAY \u00b7 BLUE \u2014 Muck Fichigan matched them stride for stride: 3-0 and 61 points, the best mark of the day. Vivace do Tinge went 2-1, Spencer Torkelson 1-2. Balz Deep went home without a win. MUCK FICHIGAN, VIVACE DO TINGE and SPENCER TORKELSON advance.","GROUP PLAY \u00b7 YELLOW \u2014 Nobody could separate. Del Bocce Vista, Trash n Stache and Dickens Cider ALL finished 2-1, and it came down to points: 58, 56, 43. Three teams in, D-Boccery out at 0-3. DEL BOCCE VISTA, TRASH N STACHE and DICKENS CIDER advance.","GROUP PLAY \u00b7 GREEN \u2014 Covid Cowboys came through the only group nobody could beat outright, finishing 2-0-1. Vandelay Industries Industries 2-1, Brothers Boor 1-1-1, and The Boys r Back never got going. COVID COWBOYS, VANDELAY INDUSTRIES INDUSTRIES and BROTHERS BOOR advance.","ROUND ONE \u2014 Dickens Cider ousted The Seekers. Del Bocce Vista saw off Spencer Torkelson. Vandelay Industries Industries ended I Can't Decide. And Trash n Stache put out Brothers Boor. Four gone, eight left, and the giants were waiting.","QUARTERFINALS \u2014 And the giants fell. Muck Fichigan held serve over Dickens Cider, but Del Bocce Vista upset Vivace do Tinge, Trash n Stache ran through the unbeaten Covid Cowboys, and then the big one: VANDELAY INDUSTRIES INDUSTRIES KNOCKED OUT THE HAWKEYES. The defending champions, 3-0 in the group, out in one game.","SEMIFINALS \u2014 Muck Fichigan turned back Del Bocce Vista to reach the final unbeaten. And Trash n Stache, who'd already taken down the Covid Cowboys, did it again \u2014 ending Vandelay Industries Industries's giant-killing run. Two teams left.","THE FINAL \u2014 Muck Fichigan: 3-0, 61 points, group champions, two clean bracket wins, not a blemish anywhere. Trash n Stache: out of the three-way logjam in Yellow, and then the hardest road in the tournament \u2014 the undefeated Covid Cowboys AND the team that put out the champions.","\ud83c\udfc6 CHAMPIONS: TRASH N STACHE \ud83c\udfc6 \u2014 Out of a three-way logjam in Yellow, past the unbeaten Covid Cowboys, past the side that had just knocked out the defending champions, and then past Muck Fichigan \u2014 3-0 in their group and unbeaten all day \u2014 with the trophy on the line. And a word for Spencer: the drunkest man ever to win this tournament. The covid year belongs to Trash n Stache."],"year":2020,"years":[2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026]}